-- ============================================================================
-- Third batch of foods
-- ============================================================================
-- 244 covered a day of ordinary eating. This covers the edges people actually
-- hit and then give up on: takeaway, the freezer aisle, brands of yoghurt and
-- bread that are their own products rather than a generic, and the Bulgarian
-- dishes the first two batches left out.
--
-- Same rules throughout. Values are per 100 g AS EATEN. data_quality 4 is a
-- standard reference value; 3 is a composite estimate for something that
-- varies by cook or by brand. Nothing is marked 5.
--
-- Every row here gets a Bulgarian alias AND a Bulgarian display name, in the
-- files that follow. Two pgTAP tests fail if one arrives without either.
-- ============================================================================

